\title{08 · Roadmap — revision 1}
\taxon{Chapter}
\meta{origin}{design/08-roadmap.md}
\meta{layer}{human}
\tag{chapter}

\p{Milestones are evidence gates, not dates. \ref{ms-foundation} is new and sits between \ref{ms-0000} and \ref{ms-0001}. It pulls forward the pieces of shape, Kan, and categorical comparison machinery needed to test the root. Later milestones package and generalize those pieces; they are not prerequisites that have been scheduled after their clients.}
